Volto 19 support. The add-on requires `@plone/volto` 19 (peer dependency `^19.0.0`, React 18, Express 4) and no longer supports Volto 17. The repository is now a pnpm monorepo and the add-on moved to `packages/volto-rss-provider`. Yarn and npm lock files were replaced by pnpm (`pnpm-lock.yaml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `packageManager: pnpm@10.20.0`, `preinstall: npx only-allow pnpm`), so the development workflow is now `pnpm install`, `pnpm start`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build`.
